# Google Drive sync (OAuth) — optional.
# Create an OAuth 2.0 "Web application" client in Google Cloud Console with the
# Drive API enabled and scope `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.appdata`.
# Authorized JavaScript origin: your app origin (e.g. http://localhost:5173)
# Authorized redirect URI:      <origin>/oauth2-callback.html
#
# NOTE: Google's "Web application" OAuth clients require the client_secret in the
# token exchange even when using PKCE. It will be present in the JS bundle.
# Create a dedicated client with drive.appdata scope only to limit blast radius.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
